{"availability":"available","full":"Vylantze/TTRPG-System","name":"TTRPG-System","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-06T06:03:46Z","updated":"2026-10-13T04:33:41Z","branch":"develop","homepage":"https://vylantze.github.io/TTRPG-System/","topics":[],"demo":"https://vylantze.github.io/TTRPG-System/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T07:36:12.819Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T07:36:12.819Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T07:36:12.819Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T22:06:24.397Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-13T07:36:12.819Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A generic character system in which classes, feats, and class abilities are composed from reusable Features.","The generic TypeScript engine and the first DnD5e 2014 character-building milestone are implemented. See engine usage and API and the Feature system specification. The 2014 catalogue currently supports Fighter, Rogue, Wizard, SRD racial options, Acolyte, and Wizard spell selections. The first React UI is implemented ahead of the remaining System work; DnD5e 2024 and PF2e remain later milestones.","DnD5e 2014 rules and reference metadata are JSON files. The engine provides a browser-safe loader and System registry for the React UI to load and unload Systems. See the JSON format and integration API."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Vylantze/TTRPG-System/blob/develop/README.md","fingerprint":"17576fda30a109f021dbe2482ac54b4702e75c151cb6cc656056ee9de86d5a3f","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:24.481Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:24.481Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A generic character system in which classes, feats, and class abilities are composed from reusable Features.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Vylantze/TTRPG-System/blob/develop/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirem